{"severity":"error","file":"errors/parse_error_20.march","start_line":4,"start_col":2,"end_line":4,"end_col":6,"message":"An attribute goes before a `fn` or `pfn`; this declaration does not take one.","code":"parse_error","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":["`@[deprecated(\"...\")]` marks functions only for now. To deprecate a type, deprecate the functions that return or take it, and say so in its module's CHANGELOG entry."],"category":"SYNTAX"}
